  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde Advance Auto Parts HR Phone Numbers\n\n1. **HR Support Center (Toll-Free):** **1-800-380-4681** *(shared directly by Advance Auto Parts)*\n\n2. **Corporate HR Phone Number:** **540-362-4911** \u2014 This is listed as the primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udce7 HR Email\nYou can also email the HR Support Center at **HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd50 Business Hours\nWhen contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udccb What HR Can Help With\nCalling the Advance Auto Parts HR number can connect you with a representative who can help with matters such as **job applications, employee benefits, interview scheduling, and workplace policies.**\n\n> **Tip:** For optimal service and shorter wait times, it is recommended to call at around **11:30 AM**, as this time tends to have less call volume.",
